      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMOR AGAIN (2) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including three wins and three placings. Comes off a (21.74) win last time, scoring by 1.75 lengths in a Grade 4 over 380m at this track. Looks well placed and should feature. COLONEL'S RANGER (1) was in winning form two back (16.59) at Q Straight but ran below best last time at Rockhampton, finishing 7th. Form from her last run is proving strong. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. SMOOTH BLAST (3) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 21.58 beating White Car. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from seven starts. Sure to measure up. EXOTIC RUBY (4) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
